## Model card

- **Name:** Space Bunny Alpha (Free preview)
- **Short description:** Anonymous stealth preview reasoning model of undisclosed vendor for coding, agentic tasks, tool use, and multimodal input. Top use case is currently unconfirmed — free limited-time preview on OpenCode Zen.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `opencode/space-bunny-free` (OpenAI-Completions compatible, `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1`); also listed as stealth model on OpenRouter. Chat Completions API.
- **Release / knowledge:** Appeared 2026-09-23 as anonymous preview (OrcaRouter listing 2026-09-23); knowledge cutoff unknown — no verified cutoff found.
- **IDs:** `opencode/space-bunny-free` (Free preview ID on Zen; vendor undisclosed)
- **Context window:** 1M tokens total (524,288 max output per Pi.dev listing) — verified via endpoint listing only, not via capability measurement.
- **Modalities:** text/image/video in (per listings); text out; reasoning yes (adjustable effort low–max); tool calls yes per listing; JSON mode unverified.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-24):** $0 / $0 per 1M input/output tokens (free limited-time preview); zero-retention provider per Zen listing; no training on user data per listing.
- **Architecture:** proprietary (undisclosed — no parameter count, license, or weights published).

